(\code{AUSPOL_ONP_ORDER=federal}) or SENATE vote (\code{senate_rank}) of the most
recent federal election dated strictly before the target.
\item \code{\link[=onp_newseat_cv]{onp_newseat_cv()}} is the spread for a backtest target, fitted only on
